stage3/checked-writes/flags-refused.a:6:6: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value of type T seen as Mutable<T>, whose readonly field flags becomes writable: a readonly field may hold something narrower than NodeFlags, which a write of T["flags"] would replace; keep flags readonly in the type it's seen as, or copy the value ({ ...value }) (adamic/invariant-mutable); use a proven upcast, cast a discriminated object union with unique literal or enum tags to members or a sub-union, or downcast along nominal class ancestry (adamic/no-unchecked-cast)
